					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 1: RESIZING TO RESOLUTION\n\nIn this example we are resizing the 500x500 image to patch resolution using the fit node and linear sampling.\nTry changing the mode to see the difference between the different ways of resizing."
