					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 2: SMALL RESOLUTION , BIG NOISE\n\nVideo Generators like Fractal Noise and Static have a resolution parameter.\nIn this patch we are using this to our advantage by rendering the static at 1\/100th of the patch resolution to get big clumps of pixels\nWe are scaling it up with Resize to patch resolution.\nNote that Nearest Sampling is used here to preserve the blocky image, try switching to Linear to see the difference."
					}
				},
